{
  "id": "field-notes",
  "title": "Field Notes",
  "description": "A quiet notebook for thoughts, next steps, and things worth keeping.",
  "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Field Notes</title>\n<style>\n:root{color-scheme:light;--paper:#f7f3e9;--ink:#203e32;--muted:#6b7164;--line:#dcded0;--soft:#e9eddf}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.5}\nmain{max-width:600px;margin:auto;padding:38px 26px 26px}\n.masthead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.mark{width:12px;height:12px;border:1px solid var(--ink);border-radius:50%;background:var(--ink);box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px var(--paper)}\n#viewer{letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:none;font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;text-align:right;color:var(--muted)}\nheader{padding:36px 0 26px}h1{font:normal clamp(46px,10vw,64px)/1.06 Georgia,\"Times New Roman\",serif;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0 0 13px}header p{color:var(--muted);margin:0;max-width:330px}\n#note-form{display:flex;gap:9px;padding:8px;background:#fffdf6;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 4px 16px #233d3005}\ninput{min-width:0;flex:1;background:transparent;border:0;padding:10px;color:var(--ink);font:inherit}input::placeholder{color:#838778}input:focus{outline:none}\n#note-form:focus-within{outline:2px solid #63876b;outline-offset:3px}\nbutton{font:inherit;cursor:pointer;border-radius:7px;border:0}button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #63876b;outline-offset:4px}button:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:default}\n.add{background:var(--ink);color:#fffdf6;padding:10px 16px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}\n.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:29px;padding-bottom:12px;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n#count{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0;color:var(--muted);text-transform:none;font-weight:400}\nul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0}li{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.check{appearance:none;flex:0 0 20px;width:20px;height:20px;padding:0;margin:2px 0 0;border:1px solid #a6b29d;border-radius:50%;cursor:pointer;display:grid;place-items:center}\n.check:checked{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink)}.check:checked:after{content:'✓';color:white;font-size:12px}\n.note{flex:1;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere;white-space:pre-wrap}.done .note{text-decoration:line-through;color:var(--muted)}\n.delete{background:transparent;color:var(--muted);padding:2px 6px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.2}.delete:hover{color:#9b4536;background:#eee5da}\n#empty{text-align:center;padding:38px 14px 40px}#empty .sprout{display:block;font:32px Georgia,serif;color:#7d9271;margin-bottom:12px}#empty strong{font:normal 22px Georgia,serif}#empty p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin:8px 0 0}\n.brief-area{margin-top:30px;padding:19px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;background:#eeeee3}\n.brief-top{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:700}.brief-button{background:transparent;border:1px solid #aebca6;padding:8px 11px;color:var(--ink);font-size:12px}\n#brief{margin-top:16px;padding-top:15px;border-top:1px solid #d3d9c8}#brief h2{font:normal 23px Georgia,serif;margin:0 0 9px}#brief p{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:0;font-size:13px}\n.status{font-size:12px;color:#8a4333;margin:10px 2px}.status:empty{display:none}footer{margin-top:26px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-align:center}\n.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip-path:inset(50%);white-space:nowrap}\n@media(max-width:380px){main{padding:25px 17px}.brief-top{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.add{padding:10px 12px}header{padding-top:29px}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<div class=\"masthead\"><span class=\"brand\"><span class=\"mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>A little room to think</span><span id=\"viewer\">Opening notebook…</span></div>\n<header><h1>Field Notes<span aria-hidden=\"true\">.</span></h1><p>Small thoughts, next steps, and things worth keeping.</p></header>\n<div id=\"note-form\">\n<label class=\"sr-only\" for=\"new-note\">New note</label>\n<input id=\"new-note\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"What’s on your mind?\" maxlength=\"400\" autocomplete=\"off\" required disabled>\n<button class=\"add\" id=\"add\" type=\"button\" disabled>Add note</button>\n</div>\n<p id=\"status\" class=\"status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n<div class=\"section-head\"><span>Your notebook</span><span id=\"count\" aria-live=\"polite\">Loading…</span></div>\n<ul id=\"notes\" aria-label=\"Notes\"></ul>\n<div id=\"empty\" hidden><span class=\"sprout\" aria-hidden=\"true\">❧</span><strong>A fresh page, just for you.</strong><p>Add your first note. A small thought is a good start.</p></div>\n<section class=\"brief-area\" aria-label=\"Project brief\">\n<div class=\"brief-top\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">A little context</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"brief-button\" id=\"read-brief\">Read project brief</button></div>\n<p id=\"brief-status\" class=\"status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n<div id=\"brief\" hidden><h2 id=\"brief-title\"></h2><p id=\"brief-text\"></p></div>\n</section>\n<footer>MAKE SPACE FOR WHAT MATTERS.</footer>\n</main>\n<script>\n(function(){\n'use strict';\nconst $=id=>document.getElementById(id);\nlet notes=[],ready=false,busy=false;\nfunction message(text){$('status').textContent=text;}\nfunction controls(){ $('new-note').disabled=!ready||busy; $('add').disabled=!ready||busy; render(); }\nfunction render(){\n $('notes').replaceChildren();\n let done=0;\n notes.forEach((note,index)=>{\n  if(note.done)done++;\n  const li=document.createElement('li');\n  if(note.done)li.className='done';\n  const check=document.createElement('input');\n  check.type='checkbox';check.className='check';check.checked=note.done;check.disabled=busy;\n  check.setAttribute('aria-label',(note.done?'Mark unfinished: ':'Mark done: ')+note.text);\n  check.addEventListener('change',()=>save(notes.map((n,i)=>i===index?{text:n.text,done:check.checked}:n)));\n  const text=document.createElement('span');text.className='note';text.textContent=note.text;\n  const del=document.createElement('button');del.type='button';del.className='delete';del.textContent='×';del.disabled=busy;\n  del.setAttribute('aria-label','Delete note: '+note.text);\n  del.addEventListener('click',()=>save(notes.filter((_,i)=>i!==index)));\n  li.append(check,text,del);$('notes').append(li);\n });\n $('count').textContent=notes.length+' '+(notes.length===1?'note':'notes')+' · '+done+' done';\n $('empty').hidden=!ready||notes.length>0;\n}\nasync function save(next){\n if(!ready||busy)return false;\n if(new TextEncoder().encode(JSON.stringify(next)).length>=15000){message('Your notebook is full. Delete a note or shorten this one to make room.');render();return false;}\n busy=true;controls();message('Saving…');\n let saved=false;\n try{await window.seed.storage.set('notes',next);notes=next;saved=true;message('Saved.');}\n catch(e){message('Could not save your change. Please try again.');}\n finally{busy=false;controls();}\n return saved;\n}\nasync function addNote(){\n const text=$('new-note').value.trim();\n if(!text||!ready||busy)return;\n if(await save([...notes,{text:text,done:false}]))$('new-note').value='';\n $('new-note').focus();\n}\n$('add').addEventListener('click',addNote);\n$('new-note').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{\n if(e.key==='Enter'&&!e.isComposing){e.preventDefault();addNote();}\n});\n$('read-brief').addEventListener('click',async()=>{\n const button=$('read-brief');button.disabled=true;\n $('brief-status').textContent='Requesting project brief…';\n try{\n  const result=await window.seed.resource('project-brief');\n  $('brief-title').textContent=result.title;\n  $('brief-text').textContent=result.text;\n  $('brief').hidden=false;$('brief-status').textContent='';\n  button.textContent='Brief opened';\n }catch(e){\n  $('brief-status').textContent='Project brief unavailable. Permission may have been denied; the brief cannot be read without host approval.';\n  button.textContent='Brief unavailable';\n }\n});\nasync function init(){\n try{const context=await window.seed.context();$('viewer').textContent=context.viewer;}\n catch(e){$('viewer').textContent='Viewer unavailable';}\n try{\n  const stored=await window.seed.storage.get('notes');\n  if(stored!==null&&(!Array.isArray(stored)||!stored.every(n=>n&&typeof n.text==='string'&&typeof n.done==='boolean')))throw new Error('Invalid notebook');\n  notes=stored||[];ready=true;controls();\n }catch(e){$('count').textContent='Unavailable';message('Could not load your notebook. Reload to try again. Editing is paused to protect your saved notes.');}\n}\ninit();\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "revision": "4f515b552c30e491a21e86294eb17211b845b8a1f276fc20da6ca7046cbdb3c4",
  "prompt": "Build a beautiful small project notebook called Field Notes. Warm cream background, forest-green accents, editorial serif title. Users can add short notes, mark a note done, delete it, and see a count. Persist notes through seed.storage under the key notes. Provide a button labelled Read project brief that calls seed.resource(\"project-brief\") and displays the result or a clear permission-denied message. Show the viewer name from seed.context(). Use accessible labels: New note for the text input and Add note for the submit button. Keep under 250 lines of HTML. The empty state should invite the first note. No default notes. Notes should survive a reload and remain separate for each account.",
  "provenance": "Local Codex agent (browser-tested revision)",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-24T01:15:48.084Z"
}
